// # Ooda CLI Docs Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the cli documentation files. The 5 files cover setup, argv parse, dispatch, command reference, and environment variables.
//
// Setup: Pure structural file. Each .oot has a 2-line clean header. Each .oo (this one) has a 4-element Academy header. Imports are the only executable content.
//
// Beats:
//   1. CLI_SETUP.oot — install paths, cap requirements, runtime env.
//   2. argv.oot — two-tier parse, per-command flag tables, how to extend.
//   3. dispatch.oot — argv router shape, lifecycle, cmd_* convention.
//   4. COMMANDS.oot — per-command reference for all 13 in-process + 3 spawned.
//   5. ENV.oot — the 11 env vars ooda reads, grouped by who sets them.

import "CLI_SETUP.oot";
import "argv.oot";
import "dispatch.oot";
import "COMMANDS.oot";
import "ENV.oot";
